   "text": "创始人的愿景",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1dd03d49b4ed58b70af7",
   "sourceHash": "1dd03d49b4ed58b70af7a016c935c3b464ad05151387642797efdb12c0003582",
   "text": "Kairali 希望帮助您转向最适宜的生活方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5883c8774ebb8ac7c207",
   "sourceHash": "5883c8774ebb8ac7c2075f5322b8ab2cd2e1cffff37aa980b96bfde72042ccf8",
   "text": "Kairali 的使命是在全球推广阿育吠陀的应用，坚守其正宗价值，为所有人促进健康与福祉。他们认为人与自然相互依存，并相信阿育吠陀能够帮助身体回归自然的和谐。Kairali 致力于成为该领域公认的先行者，开发新的天然元素，助力个人成长，改变人们的生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8c57da0cc6620b6c4e03",
   "sourceHash": "8c57da0cc6620b6c4e03ba455971513a0a73974cd321b59e7e0e1d0f2330f35b",
   "text": "The Kairali Ayurvedic Group 联合创始人",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_477cf8ff62afd8908b55",
   "sourceHash": "477cf8ff62afd8908b5513e701949f16e0f7c4a099a41dabcf190283c3268c06",
   "text": "Kairali 领导团队",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_105f667566a4b1d512ed",
   "sourceHash": "105f667566a4b1d512ed641b947d1b4dd52343dfe96c66c67d419dc279edda71",
   "text": "认识我们心怀健康世界愿景的董事们",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eb877f5848ce812e821b",
